// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/SXMPTEEX-adaptive-trend-1m/
// id: PUB;3d36ec0aebca4a4e80682ac785f2e06a  kind: strategy  likes: 425
